<span id="S1.T1.2.1.7.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1.T1.2.1.7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;instruction&gt;</span> Rewrite the given paragraph in a shorter <span id="S1.T1.2.1.7.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9FF4F;">form</span>, easier <span id="S1.T1.2.1.7.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9FF4F;">than</span> to understand form <span id="S1.T1.2.1.7.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9FF4F;">better</span>. <span id="S1.T1.2.1.7.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;\instruction&gt;</span>

<br class="ltx_break">Input: Although it is generally accepted that the internet has allowed us to connect with people all …</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S1.T1.2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S1.T1.2.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" rowspan="2"><span id="S1.T1.2.1.8.1.1" class="ltx_text">Add Misspelling</span></th>
<td id="S1.T1.2.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.8.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top">
<span id="S1.T1.2.1.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1.T1.2.1.8.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;instruction&gt;</span> Rewrite the <span id="S1.T1.2.1.8.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9FF4F;">givdn paragraphu</span> in a shorter, easier to understand <span id="S1.T1.2.1.8.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-bg-color:#D9FF4F;">frm</span>. <span id="S1.T1.2.1.8.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;\instruction&gt;</span>

<br class="ltx_break">Input: Although it is generally accepted that the internet has allowed us to connect with people all …</span>
</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
