<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix</h2>

</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Instruction-tuning Hyperparameters</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For instruction-tuning and evaluation, we adopt the implementation from Open Instruct <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib41" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wang et al., 2023</a>; <a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ivison et al., 2023</a>; <a href="#bib.bib16" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ivison et al., 2024</a>; <a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lambert et al., 2024</a>)</cite>. Table <a href="#A1.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix A Instruction-tuning Hyperparameters ‣ Fine-Tuning on Noisy Instructions: Effects on Generalization and Performance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> shows the hyperparameters used in our instruction fine-tuning experiments.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<div id="A1.T6.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:103.5pt;height:101.6pt;vertical-align:-48.9pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-16.1pt,15.8pt) scale(0.763261968493907,0.763261968493907) ;">
<table id="A1.T6.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T6.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;"><span id="A1.T6.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameter</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;"><span id="A1.T6.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Value</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">learning rate</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">1e-5</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">lr scheduler type</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">linear</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">warmup ratio</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">0.03</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.2.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">weight decay</td>
<td id="A1.T6.2.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">0</td></tr>
