<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Full Results</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In addition to the results on MMLU (5-shot), BBH (CoT) and GSM8K (CoT) presented in Table <a href="#S4.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 4.3 Implementation Details ‣ 4 Experimental Setup ‣ Fine-Tuning on Noisy Instructions: Effects on Generalization and Performance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>, we present the full results on MMLU (Table <a href="#A2.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix B Full Results ‣ Fine-Tuning on Noisy Instructions: Effects on Generalization and Performance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>), BBH (Table <a href="#A2.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Appendix B Full Results ‣ Fine-Tuning on Noisy Instructions: Effects on Generalization and Performance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>) and GSM8K (Table <a href="#A2.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Appendix B Full Results ‣ Fine-Tuning on Noisy Instructions: Effects on Generalization and Performance" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>).</p>
</div>
