<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Results of evaluating the fine-tuned models under various instruction perturbations using the GSM8K evaluation benchmark. The exact match (EM) is reported on both the original evaluation instructions (<span id="A2.T9.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">0%</span>) and the various perturbed evaluation instructions. <span id="A2.T9.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bold</span> values denote the best performance across each model.</figcaption>
</figure>
